      "Canonical Craft currently makes .craft/ledger.yml the sole project-local source of truth and explicitly lacks a database adapter or public CLI.",
      "The WaveDB README advertises relevant database capabilities, but its branch-relative claims are not executed evidence and must be pinned and verified.",
      "The result is private research and an implementation plan; no public Craft mutation, installation, promotion, or deployment is authorized."
    ],
    "binding_mode": "capability-bound",
    "execution_owner": "domainspec-subagents-strategy",
